# Comments in English

All code comments in this project must be written in English.

- Use English for single-line comments (`//`)
- Use English for multi-line comments (`/* */`)
- Use English for documentation strings (docstrings)
- Use English for QML `//` comments
- Use English for TODO/FIXME/NOTE annotations

### Examples

```qml
// Good: View mode switch and file search (height depends on content)
// Bad: Переключение режимов просмотра и поиск файлов
```

```python
# Good: Load repository configuration on startup
# Bad: Загрузить конфигурацию репозитория при запуске
```
